# 统一换行：模板会被 //go:embed 原样写进用户项目，
# 一旦带 CRLF，生成的 Makefile 在 Linux/macOS/WSL 下 make 会直接报 "missing separator"。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 专用脚本保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.exe binary
